{
  "name": "Text icon parts",
  "description": "Icon parts draw an SF Symbol inside a rich text line. Each is written with an empty literal value, so a build from before icon parts draws nothing in its place. The net line has a literal house in its own colour and size, then the words, then a template icon that renders a symbol, a template icon that renders empty and is left out, an entity icon that reads the entity's live icon over the one captured when it was picked, an mdi: name that is left out, an icon set by a rule aimed at the part that also makes it bold, and an icon hidden by a rule aimed at it. A layer rule recolours every part with no colour of its own, icons included. An icon part's text is empty and it carries its symbol; a text part carries none. A curved line leaves its icon parts out, so its parts still spell its text. The compiler walks each icon's source, so the entity and both templates are fetched.",
